     4887            B-hist B-sch B-Help T-batch B-close B-open B-reject B-client B-schet
     4888            B-attr B-exp b-incas br-fin-doc ED-notes RS-list sch-prn-doc-code
     4889            sch-curr-code B-curr sch-doc-date sch-fact-date sch-pay-date
     4890            sch-c-schet RS-receiver-payer sch-r-schet sch-BIK sch-cli-code
     4891            RS-cli-type sch-name B-cli mark-num
     4892         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     4893     VIEW FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     4894   END PROCEDURE.
     4895   PROCEDURE MainProc :
     4896     find first X_curr_sysconf no-lock where
