     6204   if error-status:error then do:
     6205     undo, return error .
     6206   end.
     6207   if loc-doc-rec <> ? then do:
     6208       RUn OpenBR in this-procedure ( input yes, input no, input '':U).
     6209       reposition br-fin-doc to recid loc-doc-rec no-error.
     6210   end.
     6211   apply "entry" to br-fin-doc in frame Dialog-Frame.
