     6855   Filter-Block:
     6856   DO ON STOP    UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block
     6857       ON ERROR   UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block
     6858       ON END-KEY UNDO Filter-Block, LEAVE Filter-Block :
