     6860                      , INPUT (filter-point + chr(4) + FILTER-LABEL)
     6861                      , INPUT tbl
     6862                      , INPUT join-tbl
     6863                      , INPUT fld
     6864                      , INPUT lab
     6865                      , INPUT spr
     6866                      , INPUT dim ).
     6867     RUN OpenBr in this-procedure ( input yes, input no, input '':U).
